    "text": {
      "en": "Stands on a 30 m concrete tower in Schuir, a rural district on the southern edge of Essen, and watches the Ruhr area and the Lower Rhine. The tower was built in 2010 and the dual-pol radar followed in 2012. In 2015 a court blocked a wind turbine 11 km away because its rotor would have disturbed the measurements."
    },
